<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ lang or summit.lang }}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<title>{% if title %}{{ title }} | {{ summit.shortName }}{% else %}{{ summit.name }} — {{ summit.tagline }}{% endif %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ page.url | absoluteUrl }}">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ summit.name }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{% if title %}{{ title }}{% else %}{{ summit.name }}{% endif %}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ description }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ page.url | absoluteUrl }}">
<meta property="og:locale" content="en_KE">
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ '/img/logo-600.jpg' | absoluteUrl }}">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

<link rel="icon" href="/img/emblem-96.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/img/apple-touch-icon.png">

{# The two faces that render the first viewport. Preloaded so the masthead and
   the engraved h1 never swap; Courier and the heavier Archivo weights can. #}
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/bricolage-grotesque.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/google-sans-flex.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{% if page.url == "/" %}<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/img/hero-poster.avif" type="image/avif" fetchpriority="high">{% endif %}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

{% block head %}{% endblock %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ConferenceEvent",
  "name": {{ summit.name | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ summit.theme | dump | safe }},
  "startDate": "{{ summit.dates.start }}",
  "endDate": "{{ summit.dates.end }}",
  "eventStatus": "https://schema.org/EventScheduled",
  "eventAttendanceMode": "https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode",
  "url": {{ summit.url | dump | safe }},
  "location": {
    "@type": "Place",
    "name": {{ (summit.location.city + ", " + summit.location.country) | dump | safe }},
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": {{ summit.location.city | dump | safe }},
      "addressCountry": {{ summit.location.countryCode | dump | safe }}
    }
  },
  "organizer": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": {{ summit.organiser.name | dump | safe }},
    "url": {{ summit.organiser.url | dump | safe }}
  }
}
</script>
</head>

<body>
<!--
DIRECTION CONTRACT · seed 14313fed · persuade · grounded candidate 4 of 7

THESIS: This summit's mechanism is trade documentation — the paperwork that moves
tea from Kericho to Fujian. The site IS that document. It refuses the conference
template (photo hero, countdown, speaker grid, sponsor wall) and its cream-editorial
opposite.

OWN-WORLD: Security print. Intaglio green ground owning whole regions, green-grey
safety-tint stock (never cream), oxblood reserved for seals and endorsements only,
canary and salmon carbon plies. Generated guilloche rosette and engine-turned rules.
Bricolage Grotesque display, Google Sans Flex UI, Google Sans Code typed data.
Steel-engraving vignettes, multiplied onto the stock.

STORY: A buyer weighing an unfamiliar first-edition summit sees a document already
in progress, reads its particulars, and registers — which issues them a numbered
entry rather than selling them a ticket.

FIRST VIEWPORT: Full-bleed intaglio ground, rosette bleeding off the right edge.
Masthead rule with document name and serial. Engraved h1 left; particulars beneath
as filled fields, unknowns as dashed unstamped boxes. Issuing panel right, on light
stock, carrying the primary action.

FORM: Bill of lading / trade certificate. Ranked 4 of 7; assigned by the roll.

FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
-->
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

<header class="site-header">
  <a class="site-header__brand" href="/" aria-label="{{ summit.name }} — home">
    <img class="brand-emblem" src="/img/emblem-96.png" srcset="/img/emblem-96.png 96w, /img/emblem-256.png 256w"
         sizes="44px" width="96" height="96" alt="" decoding="async">
    <span class="brand-lockup">
      <span class="brand-lockup__title">Kenya&#8202;/&#8202;China</span>
      <span class="brand-lockup__sub">Tea Summit</span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
    <button class="site-nav__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav">
      <span class="visually-hidden">Menu</span>
      <span class="site-nav__bars" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
    <ul class="site-nav__list" id="primary-nav">
      {% for item in navigation.primary %}
      <li><a href="{{ item.url }}"{% if page.url == item.url %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ item.text }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <a class="btn btn--primary site-header__cta" href="{{ navigation.cta.url }}">{{ navigation.cta.text }}</a>
</header>

<main id="main">
  {{ content | safe }}
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer__grid">
    {% for group in navigation.footer %}
    <nav class="site-footer__col" aria-labelledby="foot-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 class="site-footer__heading" id="foot-{{ loop.index }}">{{ group.heading }}</h2>
      <ul>
        {% for link in group.links %}
        <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.text }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </nav>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="site-footer__base">
    <p>{{ summit.name }} &middot; {{ summit.dates.display }} &middot; {{ summit.location.city }}, {{ summit.location.country }}</p>
    <p>Issued by {{ summit.organiser.name }}, {{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}.</p>
    <p>&copy; {{ buildYear }} {{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/js/nav.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/form-handler.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/hero.js" defer></script>
{% block scripts %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
